From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 08:51:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] [Chooser] Declare the largest size instead of forcing
 it at start

With "adjust refresh rate" on and the GUI below the largest allowed
resolution, the first segment was forced to the top representation.
That let Kodi switch the display mode for it, but on a slow link the
segment took longer to load than it played, and playback stalled.
